> On Oct 2, 2026, at 15:25, Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com> wrote:
>=20
> The TLS WG is going to meet at IETF 127; you may have just seen the =
request fly by. For planning purposes, the chairs would like to solicit =
input from the WG for agenda topics. Send your agenda topics request and =
an estimate for how much time you will need to tls-chairs@ietf.org. Make =
sure to include time for discussion! Please note that we will prioritize =
existing WG items. Please also review the guidance for TLS WG presenters =
that can be found at [0].
>=20
> Cheers,
> spt (for the chairs)
>=20
> [0] https://github.com/tlswg/tlswg-wiki/blob/master/FAQ.md

